0.1.3-dev - 2026/05/08 (d873f97) [develop]
    :brief 建立 first-party research runtime
        - feat(server/runtime): 新增 packages/server/src/research/runtime 作为 paper_fucker 权威运行时模块
        - feat(run-store): 支持 workspace-first <workspace>/.paper_fucker/runs/<run-id>, ~/.paper_fucker/runs fallback, create/resume/status API
        - feat(events): 事件写入 append-only events.jsonl, 并刷新 run-local/global SQLite index
        - feat(artifacts): 支持 artifact 规范化 sha256、逻辑路径版本化、supersedes 元数据和 locked 最新版本保护
        - feat(policy): 默认 Full Access + Unlimited Research, bounded 模式支持 3h 默认和 24h 上限
        - feat(resources): 运行时自动记录 platform/arch/hostname/cpu/memory/GPU hint 资源快照
        - feat(cost): 支持 LLM/API/total soft budget 累计与 budget.alert 事件
        - feat(gate): 新增 final gate 状态, 支持 open/passed/blocked 与 blockers
        - feat(otel): create/resume/status/event/artifact/cost/final gate/index refresh 均接入 paper_fucker.research OpenTelemetry spans
        - docs(readme): 明确运行时自动 API 调用、workspace-first run store 和 packages/opencode adapter 边界
        - chore(taskflow): 完成 task-005-research-runtime 并记录 runtime smoke report
    :src
        - packages/server/src/research/runtime/paths.ts - run directory resolution, workspace/home storage selection, artifact path safety
        - packages/server/src/research/runtime/run-store.ts - run lifecycle, event append, index refresh, cost/final gate APIs
        - packages/server/src/research/runtime/artifact-store.ts - artifact writes, versioning, stable hash, locked protection
        - packages/server/src/research/runtime/policy.ts - permission, bounded mode, resource detection, budget state
        - packages/server/src/research/runtime/state.ts - runtime-state.json persistence
        - packages/server/test/research/runtime.test.ts - runtime smoke tests
        - reports/research-runtime-smoke.md - verification report
    :doc
        - README.md - version 0.1.3-dev and first-party runtime structure
        - .plan/confirmed/task-005-research-runtime.yaml - TaskFlow execution logs and OpenCode wording correction
    :verification
